{"id":"6c1845536b726c45","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-computation-coding.md","title":"有限计算编码与一元计算见证","display":"df-computation-coding — 有限计算编码与一元计算见证","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-computation-coding","aliases":["18-df-computation-coding"],"display":"df-computation-coding — 有限计算编码与一元计算见证","depends_on":["[[18-df-primitive-recursive-terms]]","[[18-thm-primitive-recursive-relation-closure]]"],"source_correspondence":"补齐未提供的计算编码接口","local_revision":"2026-10-14","verification_status":"local-mathematical-reconstruction; not-machine-checked","patch_revision":"2026-10-14","patch_verification_status":"local-formalization-review; not-machine-checked","patch_review_scope":"明确输出函数 U 的标量输入域以及检查特征函数的三元输入域；编码、记录规则与代表项选择保持不变。","patch_source_review":"no new source-page or source-proof verification"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-computation-coding"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-computation-coding</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-computation-coding — 有限计算编码与一元计算见证"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f04544345afa1f92\" href=\"?note=f04544345afa1f92\" title=\"18-df-primitive-recursive-terms\">18-df-primitive-recursive-terms</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"88497c28c97d78b7\" href=\"?note=88497c28c97d78b7\" title=\"18-thm-primitive-recursive-relation-closure\">18-thm-primitive-recursive-relation-closure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_correspondence","html":"补齐未提供的计算编码接口"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"2026-10-14"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local-mathematical-reconstruction; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"patch_revision","html":"2026-10-14"},{"key":"patch_verification_status","html":"local-formalization-review; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"patch_review_scope","html":"明确输出函数 U 的标量输入域以及检查特征函数的三元输入域；编码、记录规则与代表项选择保持不变。"},{"key":"patch_source_review","html":"no new source-page or source-proof verification"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 与本原递归函数项见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f04544345afa1f92\" href=\"?note=f04544345afa1f92\" title=\"18-df-primitive-recursive-terms\">18-df-primitive-recursive-terms</a>；其布尔、有界闭包见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"88497c28c97d78b7\" href=\"?note=88497c28c97d78b7\" title=\"18-thm-primitive-recursive-relation-closure\">18-thm-primitive-recursive-relation-closure</a>。本节点在 ZFC 中固定一套本地数码，不把“标准 Kleene 编码”作为未定义参数。除已注明的函数项树之外，本节点的小写变量取自然数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec a\">\\(\\vec a\\)</span> 为有限自然数列。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{sc}\">\\(\\operatorname{sc}\\)</span> 编码有限列，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{len},\\operatorname{hd},\\operatorname{tl},[\\ ]_i\">\\(\\operatorname{len},\\operatorname{hd},\\operatorname{tl},[\\ ]_i\\)</span> 在全部自然数上定义；越界分量为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a(e)\">\\(a(e)\\)</span> 是程序元数加一，非法程序取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>，因此零元程序不与非法程序混同。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_S,p_C,p_P,p_{\\mathrm{sub}},p_{\\mathrm{rec}},p_\\mu\">\\(p_S,p_C,p_P,p_{\\mathrm{sub}},p_{\\mathrm{rec}},p_\\mu\\)</span> 是下式定义的程序构造码，不是新加的可计算性公理。元数检查按程序码的严格较小子码递归。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec h\">\\(\\vec h\\)</span> 长度为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\ge1\">\\(m\\ge1\\)</span>；子程序及参数在构造码中可唯一解析。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rule}(e,c,y;s,i)\">\\(\\mathrm{Rule}(e,c,y;s,i)\\)</span> 只读取长度为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 的既有记录前缀；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span> 编码当前输入元组。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Seen}\">\\(\\mathrm{Seen}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_j,I_j,O_j\">\\(E_j,I_j,O_j\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Good}\">\\(\\mathrm{Good}\\)</span> 是有限记录的检查谓词与投影。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf T^1\">\\(\\mathsf T^1\\)</span> 是一元输入的计算见证，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U:\\omega\\to\\omega\">\\(U:\\omega\\to\\omega\\)</span> 提取最后输出；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Lift}_1\">\\(\\operatorname{Lift}_1\\)</span> 采用本原递归函数项节点的输入转换。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_e\">\\(\\Phi_e\\)</span> 定义为关系图；下式同时给出其单值性，不预设总性。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\#_{\\mathrm{PR}}\">\\(\\#_{\\mathrm{PR}}\\)</span> 将现有本原递归函数项注入相同程序编码；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Rep}_n(g)\">\\(\\operatorname{Rep}_n(g)\\)</span> 用最小代码唯一确定给定本原递归函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\\in\\mathrm{PR}^{18}_n\">\\(g\\in\\mathrm{PR}^{18}_n\\)</span> 的代表项，不使用未指定的选择。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_T\">\\(a_T\\)</span> 为计算检查特征函数的代表项。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,C,P,\\operatorname{Sub},\\operatorname{Rec}\">\\(S,C,P,\\operatorname{Sub},\\operatorname{Rec}\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\#_{\\mathrm{PR}}\">\\(\\#_{\\mathrm{PR}}\\)</span> 的方程中是函数项构造子；相应 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 是自然数构造码。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nq(0)&amp;\\coloneqq0,&amp;q(n+1)&amp;\\coloneqq q(n)+n+1,\\\\\n\\operatorname{pair}(a,b)&amp;\\coloneqq q(a+b)+b,\\\\\n\\pi_0(z)&amp;\\coloneqq\\iota a\\le z\\;\\exists b\\le z\\;(\\operatorname{pair}(a,b)=z),\\\\\n\\pi_1(z)&amp;\\coloneqq\\iota b\\le z\\;\\exists a\\le z\\;(\\operatorname{pair}(a,b)=z),\\\\\n\\operatorname{cons}(a,b)&amp;\\coloneqq1+\\operatorname{pair}(a,b),\\\\\n\\operatorname{sc}(\\langle\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq0,&amp;\n\\operatorname{sc}(\\langle a\\rangle{}^\\frown\\vec b)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{cons}(a,\\operatorname{sc}(\\vec b)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{hd}(0)&amp;\\coloneqq0,&amp;\\operatorname{hd}(z+1)&amp;\\coloneqq\\pi_0(z),\\\\\n\\operatorname{tl}(0)&amp;\\coloneqq0,&amp;\\operatorname{tl}(z+1)&amp;\\coloneqq\\pi_1(z),\\\\\n\\operatorname{len}(0)&amp;\\coloneqq0,&amp;\\operatorname{len}(z+1)&amp;\\coloneqq1+\\operatorname{len}(\\pi_1(z)),\\\\\n[z]_0&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{hd}(z),&amp;[z]_{i+1}&amp;\\coloneqq[\\operatorname{tl}(z)]_i.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nq(0)&amp;\\coloneqq0,&amp;q(n+1)&amp;\\coloneqq q(n)+n+1,\\\\\n\\operatorname{pair}(a,b)&amp;\\coloneqq q(a+b)+b,\\\\\n\\pi_0(z)&amp;\\coloneqq\\iota a\\le z\\;\\exists b\\le z\\;(\\operatorname{pair}(a,b)=z),\\\\\n\\pi_1(z)&amp;\\coloneqq\\iota b\\le z\\;\\exists a\\le z\\;(\\operatorname{pair}(a,b)=z),\\\\\n\\operatorname{cons}(a,b)&amp;\\coloneqq1+\\operatorname{pair}(a,b),\\\\\n\\operatorname{sc}(\\langle\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq0,&amp;\n\\operatorname{sc}(\\langle a\\rangle{}^\\frown\\vec b)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{cons}(a,\\operatorname{sc}(\\vec b)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{hd}(0)&amp;\\coloneqq0,&amp;\\operatorname{hd}(z+1)&amp;\\coloneqq\\pi_0(z),\\\\\n\\operatorname{tl}(0)&amp;\\coloneqq0,&amp;\\operatorname{tl}(z+1)&amp;\\coloneqq\\pi_1(z),\\\\\n\\operatorname{len}(0)&amp;\\coloneqq0,&amp;\\operatorname{len}(z+1)&amp;\\coloneqq1+\\operatorname{len}(\\pi_1(z)),\\\\\n[z]_0&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{hd}(z),&amp;[z]_{i+1}&amp;\\coloneqq[\\operatorname{tl}(z)]_i.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\np_S&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{sc}(\\langle0\\rangle),&amp;\np_C(n,k)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{sc}(\\langle1,n,k\\rangle),\\\\\np_P(n,i)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{sc}(\\langle2,n,i\\rangle),&amp;\np_{\\mathrm{sub}}(g,\\vec h)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{sc}(\\langle3,g,\\operatorname{sc}(\\vec h)\\rangle),\\\\\np_{\\mathrm{rec}}(g,h)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{sc}(\\langle4,g,h\\rangle),&amp;\np_\\mu(g)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{sc}(\\langle5,g\\rangle),\\\\\na(e)&amp;\\coloneqq\\max(\\{0\\}\\cup\\{d\\le e+1:\\mathcal A(e,d)\\})\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\np_S&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{sc}(\\langle0\\rangle),&amp;\np_C(n,k)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{sc}(\\langle1,n,k\\rangle),\\\\\np_P(n,i)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{sc}(\\langle2,n,i\\rangle),&amp;\np_{\\mathrm{sub}}(g,\\vec h)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{sc}(\\langle3,g,\\operatorname{sc}(\\vec h)\\rangle),\\\\\np_{\\mathrm{rec}}(g,h)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{sc}(\\langle4,g,h\\rangle),&amp;\np_\\mu(g)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{sc}(\\langle5,g\\rangle),\\\\\na(e)&amp;\\coloneqq\\max(\\{0\\}\\cup\\{d\\le e+1:\\mathcal A(e,d)\\})\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal A(e,d)\\longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n(e=p_S\\land d=2)\\lor\\exists n,k\\le e\\;(e=p_C(n,k)\\land d=n+1)\\\\\n&amp;\\lor\\exists n,j\\le e\\;(e=p_P(n,j)\\land j&lt;n\\land d=n+1)\\\\\n&amp;\\lor\\exists n,m\\le e\\;\\exists g,h&lt;e\\;(\ne=\\operatorname{sc}(\\langle3,g,h\\rangle)\\land\\operatorname{len}(h)=m\\ge1\n\\land a(g)=m+1\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{33mm}\\land\\forall j&lt;m\\;([h]_j&lt;e\\land a([h]_j)=n+1)\\land d=n+1)\\\\\n&amp;\\lor\\exists n\\le e\\;\\exists g,h&lt;e\\;(e=p_{\\mathrm{rec}}(g,h)\\land a(g)=n+1\\land a(h)=n+3\\land d=n+2)\\\\\n&amp;\\lor\\exists n\\le e\\;\\exists g&lt;e\\;(e=p_\\mu(g)\\land a(g)=n+2\\land d=n+1).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal A(e,d)\\longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n(e=p_S\\land d=2)\\lor\\exists n,k\\le e\\;(e=p_C(n,k)\\land d=n+1)\\\\\n&amp;\\lor\\exists n,j\\le e\\;(e=p_P(n,j)\\land j&lt;n\\land d=n+1)\\\\\n&amp;\\lor\\exists n,m\\le e\\;\\exists g,h&lt;e\\;(\ne=\\operatorname{sc}(\\langle3,g,h\\rangle)\\land\\operatorname{len}(h)=m\\ge1\n\\land a(g)=m+1\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{33mm}\\land\\forall j&lt;m\\;([h]_j&lt;e\\land a([h]_j)=n+1)\\land d=n+1)\\\\\n&amp;\\lor\\exists n\\le e\\;\\exists g,h&lt;e\\;(e=p_{\\mathrm{rec}}(g,h)\\land a(g)=n+1\\land a(h)=n+3\\land d=n+2)\\\\\n&amp;\\lor\\exists n\\le e\\;\\exists g&lt;e\\;(e=p_\\mu(g)\\land a(g)=n+2\\land d=n+1).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nE_j(s)&amp;\\coloneqq[[s]_j]_0,&amp;I_j(s)&amp;\\coloneqq[[s]_j]_1,&amp;O_j(s)&amp;\\coloneqq[[s]_j]_2,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Seen}_{s,i}(g,c,y)&amp;\\longleftrightarrow\n\\exists j&lt;i\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{len}([s]_j)=3\\land E_j(s)=g\\land I_j(s)=c\\land O_j(s)=y\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nE_j(s)&amp;\\coloneqq[[s]_j]_0,&amp;I_j(s)&amp;\\coloneqq[[s]_j]_1,&amp;O_j(s)&amp;\\coloneqq[[s]_j]_2,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Seen}_{s,i}(g,c,y)&amp;\\longleftrightarrow\n\\exists j&lt;i\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{len}([s]_j)=3\\land E_j(s)=g\\land I_j(s)=c\\land O_j(s)=y\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Rule}(e,c,y;s,i)\\longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\na(e)&gt;0\\land\\operatorname{len}(c)+1=a(e)\\land\\Bigl[\\\\\n&amp;(e=p_S\\land y=[c]_0+1)\\\\\n&amp;\\lor\\exists n,k\\le e\\;(e=p_C(n,k)\\land y=k)\\\\\n&amp;\\lor\\exists n,j\\le e\\;(e=p_P(n,j)\\land j&lt;n\\land y=[c]_j)\\\\\n&amp;\\lor\\exists g,h\\le e\\;\\Bigl(e=\\operatorname{sc}(\\langle3,g,h\\rangle)\\land\n\\exists j&lt;i\\;\\bigl(E_j(s)=g\\land O_j(s)=y\\land\n\\operatorname{len}(I_j(s))=\\operatorname{len}(h)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{45mm}\\land\\forall k&lt;\\operatorname{len}(h)\\;\n\\mathrm{Seen}_{s,i}([h]_k,c,[I_j(s)]_k)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\lor\\exists g,h\\le e\\;\\Bigl(e=p_{\\mathrm{rec}}(g,h)\\land\\bigl[\n([c]_0=0\\land\\mathrm{Seen}_{s,i}(g,\\operatorname{tl}(c),y))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{20mm}\\lor\\exists k&lt;[c]_0\\;\\exists j&lt;i\\;(\n[c]_0=k+1\\land E_j(s)=e\\land I_j(s)=\\operatorname{cons}(k,\\operatorname{tl}(c))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{40mm}\\land\\mathrm{Seen}_{s,i}\n(h,\\operatorname{cons}(k,\\operatorname{cons}(O_j(s),\\operatorname{tl}(c))),y))\\bigr]\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\lor\\exists g\\le e\\;\\Bigl(e=p_\\mu(g)\\land\\mathrm{Seen}_{s,i}(g,\\operatorname{cons}(y,c),0)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{25mm}\\land\\forall u&lt;y\\;\\exists j&lt;i\\;(E_j(s)=g\\land I_j(s)=\\operatorname{cons}(u,c)\\land O_j(s)&gt;0)\\Bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Rule}(e,c,y;s,i)\\longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\na(e)&gt;0\\land\\operatorname{len}(c)+1=a(e)\\land\\Bigl[\\\\\n&amp;(e=p_S\\land y=[c]_0+1)\\\\\n&amp;\\lor\\exists n,k\\le e\\;(e=p_C(n,k)\\land y=k)\\\\\n&amp;\\lor\\exists n,j\\le e\\;(e=p_P(n,j)\\land j&lt;n\\land y=[c]_j)\\\\\n&amp;\\lor\\exists g,h\\le e\\;\\Bigl(e=\\operatorname{sc}(\\langle3,g,h\\rangle)\\land\n\\exists j&lt;i\\;\\bigl(E_j(s)=g\\land O_j(s)=y\\land\n\\operatorname{len}(I_j(s))=\\operatorname{len}(h)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{45mm}\\land\\forall k&lt;\\operatorname{len}(h)\\;\n\\mathrm{Seen}_{s,i}([h]_k,c,[I_j(s)]_k)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\lor\\exists g,h\\le e\\;\\Bigl(e=p_{\\mathrm{rec}}(g,h)\\land\\bigl[\n([c]_0=0\\land\\mathrm{Seen}_{s,i}(g,\\operatorname{tl}(c),y))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{20mm}\\lor\\exists k&lt;[c]_0\\;\\exists j&lt;i\\;(\n[c]_0=k+1\\land E_j(s)=e\\land I_j(s)=\\operatorname{cons}(k,\\operatorname{tl}(c))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{40mm}\\land\\mathrm{Seen}_{s,i}\n(h,\\operatorname{cons}(k,\\operatorname{cons}(O_j(s),\\operatorname{tl}(c))),y))\\bigr]\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\lor\\exists g\\le e\\;\\Bigl(e=p_\\mu(g)\\land\\mathrm{Seen}_{s,i}(g,\\operatorname{cons}(y,c),0)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{25mm}\\land\\forall u&lt;y\\;\\exists j&lt;i\\;(E_j(s)=g\\land I_j(s)=\\operatorname{cons}(u,c)\\land O_j(s)&gt;0)\\Bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Good}(s)&amp;\\longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{len}(s)&gt;0\\land\n\\forall i&lt;\\operatorname{len}(s)\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{len}([s]_i)=3\\land\n\\mathrm{Rule}(E_i(s),I_i(s),O_i(s);s,i)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathsf T^1(e,x,s)&amp;\\longleftrightarrow a(e)=2\\land\\mathrm{Good}(s)\\land\nE_{\\max\\{\\operatorname{len}(s),1\\}-1}(s)=e\\land I_{\\max\\{\\operatorname{len}(s),1\\}-1}(s)=\\operatorname{sc}(\\langle x\\rangle),\\\\\nU(s)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}O_{\\max\\{\\operatorname{len}(s),1\\}-1}(s)&amp;\\operatorname{len}(s)&gt;0,\\\\0&amp;\\operatorname{len}(s)=0,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\Phi_e&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(x,y)\\in\\omega^2:\\exists s\\in\\omega\\;(\\mathsf T^1(e,x,s)\\land U(s)=y)\\},\\\\\n\\forall e,x,s,t\\in\\omega\\;&amp;\\bigl((\\mathsf T^1(e,x,s)\\land\\mathsf T^1(e,x,t))\\to U(s)=U(t)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\chi_T&amp;:\\omega^3\\to\\{0,1\\},\\\\\n\\chi_T(e,x,s)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1&amp;\\mathsf T^1(e,x,s),\\\\0&amp;\\neg\\mathsf T^1(e,x,s),\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\chi_T&amp;\\in\\mathrm{PR}^{18}_3,\\qquad \\operatorname{Lift}_1(U)\\in\\mathrm{PR}^{18}_1.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Good}(s)&amp;\\longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{len}(s)&gt;0\\land\n\\forall i&lt;\\operatorname{len}(s)\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{len}([s]_i)=3\\land\n\\mathrm{Rule}(E_i(s),I_i(s),O_i(s);s,i)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathsf T^1(e,x,s)&amp;\\longleftrightarrow a(e)=2\\land\\mathrm{Good}(s)\\land\nE_{\\max\\{\\operatorname{len}(s),1\\}-1}(s)=e\\land I_{\\max\\{\\operatorname{len}(s),1\\}-1}(s)=\\operatorname{sc}(\\langle x\\rangle),\\\\\nU(s)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}O_{\\max\\{\\operatorname{len}(s),1\\}-1}(s)&amp;\\operatorname{len}(s)&gt;0,\\\\0&amp;\\operatorname{len}(s)=0,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\Phi_e&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(x,y)\\in\\omega^2:\\exists s\\in\\omega\\;(\\mathsf T^1(e,x,s)\\land U(s)=y)\\},\\\\\n\\forall e,x,s,t\\in\\omega\\;&amp;\\bigl((\\mathsf T^1(e,x,s)\\land\\mathsf T^1(e,x,t))\\to U(s)=U(t)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\chi_T&amp;:\\omega^3\\to\\{0,1\\},\\\\\n\\chi_T(e,x,s)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1&amp;\\mathsf T^1(e,x,s),\\\\0&amp;\\neg\\mathsf T^1(e,x,s),\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\chi_T&amp;\\in\\mathrm{PR}^{18}_3,\\qquad \\operatorname{Lift}_1(U)\\in\\mathrm{PR}^{18}_1.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\#_{\\mathrm{PR}}(S)&amp;\\coloneqq p_S,&amp;\n\\#_{\\mathrm{PR}}(C_k^n)&amp;\\coloneqq p_C(n,k),&amp;\n\\#_{\\mathrm{PR}}(P_i^n)&amp;\\coloneqq p_P(n,i-1),\\\\\n\\#_{\\mathrm{PR}}(\\operatorname{Sub}(g,h_1,\\ldots,h_m))\n&amp;\\coloneqq p_{\\mathrm{sub}}(\\#_{\\mathrm{PR}}(g),\\langle\\#_{\\mathrm{PR}}(h_1),\\ldots,\\#_{\\mathrm{PR}}(h_m)\\rangle),\\\\\n\\#_{\\mathrm{PR}}(\\operatorname{Rec}(g,h))&amp;\\coloneqq\np_{\\mathrm{rec}}(\\#_{\\mathrm{PR}}(g),\\#_{\\mathrm{PR}}(h)),\\\\\nM_n(g)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\#_{\\mathrm{PR}}(t):t\\in\\mathrm{PRTerm}_n,\\ \\forall\\vec x\\in\\omega^n\\;(\\operatorname{ev}(t,\\vec x)=g(\\vec x))\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Rep}_n(g)&amp;\\coloneqq\\iota t\\in\\mathrm{PRTerm}_n\\;(\\#_{\\mathrm{PR}}(t)=\\min M_n(g))\n\\quad(g\\in\\mathrm{PR}^{18}_n),\\\\\na_T&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Rep}_3(\\chi_T).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\#_{\\mathrm{PR}}(S)&amp;\\coloneqq p_S,&amp;\n\\#_{\\mathrm{PR}}(C_k^n)&amp;\\coloneqq p_C(n,k),&amp;\n\\#_{\\mathrm{PR}}(P_i^n)&amp;\\coloneqq p_P(n,i-1),\\\\\n\\#_{\\mathrm{PR}}(\\operatorname{Sub}(g,h_1,\\ldots,h_m))\n&amp;\\coloneqq p_{\\mathrm{sub}}(\\#_{\\mathrm{PR}}(g),\\langle\\#_{\\mathrm{PR}}(h_1),\\ldots,\\#_{\\mathrm{PR}}(h_m)\\rangle),\\\\\n\\#_{\\mathrm{PR}}(\\operatorname{Rec}(g,h))&amp;\\coloneqq\np_{\\mathrm{rec}}(\\#_{\\mathrm{PR}}(g),\\#_{\\mathrm{PR}}(h)),\\\\\nM_n(g)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\#_{\\mathrm{PR}}(t):t\\in\\mathrm{PRTerm}_n,\\ \\forall\\vec x\\in\\omega^n\\;(\\operatorname{ev}(t,\\vec x)=g(\\vec x))\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Rep}_n(g)&amp;\\coloneqq\\iota t\\in\\mathrm{PRTerm}_n\\;(\\#_{\\mathrm{PR}}(t)=\\min M_n(g))\n\\quad(g\\in\\mathrm{PR}^{18}_n),\\\\\na_T&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Rep}_3(\\chi_T).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>补齐可证递归函数定义实际使用、但原包没有提供的计算编码。有限列编码的尾码严格小于非空原码；程序子码也严格较小，因此长度和元数递归良定义。记录规则只引用更早记录，且对最小化检查所有较小候选的正输出。对有限有效记录作归纳可得相同程序与输入的输出唯一。全部检查均由本原递归投影、有限嵌套循环及有界量化组成，故检查特征函数属于三元本原递归类，输出投影经 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Lift}_1\">\\(\\operatorname{Lift}_1\\)</span> 转换后属于一元本原递归类。代表项选择基于非空自然数代码集的最小值，确定性不依赖任意选择。</p>\n<p>这是由现有函数项、复合、递归与无界最小化上下文重建的局部正规形编码，不声称逐字恢复缺失的源书编码，也不要求源书与本地指标逐数相同。下游可证性始终使用这里固定的代表项；更换数码系统的理论内等价不是默许条件。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-primitive-recursive-terms","status":"resolved","id":"f04544345afa1f92","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-primitive-recursive-terms]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-thm-primitive-recursive-relation-closure","status":"resolved","id":"88497c28c97d78b7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-thm-primitive-recursive-relation-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-primitive-recursive-terms","status":"resolved","id":"f04544345afa1f92","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\omega$ 与本原递归函数项见 [[18-df-primitive-recursive-terms]]；其布尔、有界闭包见 [[18-thm-primitive-recursive-relation-closure]]。本节点在 ZFC 中固定一套本地数码，不把“标准 Kleene 编码”作为未定义参数。除已注明的函数项树之外，本节点的小写变量取自然数，$\\vec a$ 为有限自然数列。$\\operatorname{sc}$ 编码有限列，$\\operatorname{len},\\operatorname{hd},\\operatorname{tl},[\\ ]_i$ 在全部自然数上定义；越界分量为 $0$。$a(e)$ 是程序元数加一，非法程序取 $0$，因此零元程序不与非法程序混同。","embed":false},{"target":"18-thm-primitive-recursive-relation-closure","status":"resolved","id":"88497c28c97d78b7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\omega$ 与本原递归函数项见 [[18-df-primitive-recursive-terms]]；其布尔、有界闭包见 [[18-thm-primitive-recursive-relation-closure]]。本节点在 ZFC 中固定一套本地数码，不把“标准 Kleene 编码”作为未定义参数。除已注明的函数项树之外，本节点的小写变量取自然数，$\\vec a$ 为有限自然数列。$\\operatorname{sc}$ 编码有限列，$\\operatorname{len},\\operatorname{hd},\\operatorname{tl},[\\ ]_i$ 在全部自然数上定义；越界分量为 $0$。$a(e)$ 是程序元数加一，非法程序取 $0$，因此零元程序不与非法程序混同。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec a","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{sc}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{len},\\operatorname{hd},\\operatorname{tl},[\\ ]_i","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"a(e)","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"p_S,p_C,p_P,p_{\\mathrm{sub}},p_{\\mathrm{rec}},p_\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec h","display":false},{"tex":"m\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rule}(e,c,y;s,i)","display":false},{"tex":"i","display":false},{"tex":"c","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Seen}","display":false},{"tex":"E_j,I_j,O_j","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Good}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf T^1","display":false},{"tex":"U:\\omega\\to\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Lift}_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi_e","display":false},{"tex":"\\#_{\\mathrm{PR}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Rep}_n(g)","display":false},{"tex":"g\\in\\mathrm{PR}^{18}_n","display":false},{"tex":"a_T","display":false},{"tex":"S,C,P,\\operatorname{Sub},\\operatorname{Rec}","display":false},{"tex":"\\#_{\\mathrm{PR}}","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nq(0)&\\coloneqq0,&q(n+1)&\\coloneqq q(n)+n+1,\\\\\n\\operatorname{pair}(a,b)&\\coloneqq q(a+b)+b,\\\\\n\\pi_0(z)&\\coloneqq\\iota a\\le z\\;\\exists b\\le z\\;(\\operatorname{pair}(a,b)=z),\\\\\n\\pi_1(z)&\\coloneqq\\iota b\\le z\\;\\exists a\\le z\\;(\\operatorname{pair}(a,b)=z),\\\\\n\\operatorname{cons}(a,b)&\\coloneqq1+\\operatorname{pair}(a,b),\\\\\n\\operatorname{sc}(\\langle\\rangle)&\\coloneqq0,&\n\\operatorname{sc}(\\langle a\\rangle{}^\\frown\\vec b)&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{cons}(a,\\operatorname{sc}(\\vec b)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{hd}(0)&\\coloneqq0,&\\operatorname{hd}(z+1)&\\coloneqq\\pi_0(z),\\\\\n\\operatorname{tl}(0)&\\coloneqq0,&\\operatorname{tl}(z+1)&\\coloneqq\\pi_1(z),\\\\\n\\operatorname{len}(0)&\\coloneqq0,&\\operatorname{len}(z+1)&\\coloneqq1+\\operatorname{len}(\\pi_1(z)),\\\\\n[z]_0&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{hd}(z),&[z]_{i+1}&\\coloneqq[\\operatorname{tl}(z)]_i.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\np_S&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{sc}(\\langle0\\rangle),&\np_C(n,k)&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{sc}(\\langle1,n,k\\rangle),\\\\\np_P(n,i)&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{sc}(\\langle2,n,i\\rangle),&\np_{\\mathrm{sub}}(g,\\vec h)&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{sc}(\\langle3,g,\\operatorname{sc}(\\vec h)\\rangle),\\\\\np_{\\mathrm{rec}}(g,h)&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{sc}(\\langle4,g,h\\rangle),&\np_\\mu(g)&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{sc}(\\langle5,g\\rangle),\\\\\na(e)&\\coloneqq\\max(\\{0\\}\\cup\\{d\\le e+1:\\mathcal A(e,d)\\})\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal A(e,d)\\longleftrightarrow{}&\n(e=p_S\\land d=2)\\lor\\exists n,k\\le e\\;(e=p_C(n,k)\\land d=n+1)\\\\\n&\\lor\\exists n,j\\le e\\;(e=p_P(n,j)\\land j<n\\land d=n+1)\\\\\n&\\lor\\exists n,m\\le e\\;\\exists g,h<e\\;(\ne=\\operatorname{sc}(\\langle3,g,h\\rangle)\\land\\operatorname{len}(h)=m\\ge1\n\\land a(g)=m+1\\\\\n&\\hspace{33mm}\\land\\forall j<m\\;([h]_j<e\\land a([h]_j)=n+1)\\land d=n+1)\\\\\n&\\lor\\exists n\\le e\\;\\exists g,h<e\\;(e=p_{\\mathrm{rec}}(g,h)\\land a(g)=n+1\\land a(h)=n+3\\land d=n+2)\\\\\n&\\lor\\exists n\\le e\\;\\exists g<e\\;(e=p_\\mu(g)\\land a(g)=n+2\\land d=n+1).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nE_j(s)&\\coloneqq[[s]_j]_0,&I_j(s)&\\coloneqq[[s]_j]_1,&O_j(s)&\\coloneqq[[s]_j]_2,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Seen}_{s,i}(g,c,y)&\\longleftrightarrow\n\\exists j<i\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{len}([s]_j)=3\\land E_j(s)=g\\land I_j(s)=c\\land O_j(s)=y\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Rule}(e,c,y;s,i)\\longleftrightarrow{}&\na(e)>0\\land\\operatorname{len}(c)+1=a(e)\\land\\Bigl[\\\\\n&(e=p_S\\land y=[c]_0+1)\\\\\n&\\lor\\exists n,k\\le e\\;(e=p_C(n,k)\\land y=k)\\\\\n&\\lor\\exists n,j\\le e\\;(e=p_P(n,j)\\land j<n\\land y=[c]_j)\\\\\n&\\lor\\exists g,h\\le e\\;\\Bigl(e=\\operatorname{sc}(\\langle3,g,h\\rangle)\\land\n\\exists j<i\\;\\bigl(E_j(s)=g\\land O_j(s)=y\\land\n\\operatorname{len}(I_j(s))=\\operatorname{len}(h)\\\\\n&\\hspace{45mm}\\land\\forall k<\\operatorname{len}(h)\\;\n\\mathrm{Seen}_{s,i}([h]_k,c,[I_j(s)]_k)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\lor\\exists g,h\\le e\\;\\Bigl(e=p_{\\mathrm{rec}}(g,h)\\land\\bigl[\n([c]_0=0\\land\\mathrm{Seen}_{s,i}(g,\\operatorname{tl}(c),y))\\\\\n&\\hspace{20mm}\\lor\\exists k<[c]_0\\;\\exists j<i\\;(\n[c]_0=k+1\\land E_j(s)=e\\land I_j(s)=\\operatorname{cons}(k,\\operatorname{tl}(c))\\\\\n&\\hspace{40mm}\\land\\mathrm{Seen}_{s,i}\n(h,\\operatorname{cons}(k,\\operatorname{cons}(O_j(s),\\operatorname{tl}(c))),y))\\bigr]\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\lor\\exists g\\le e\\;\\Bigl(e=p_\\mu(g)\\land\\mathrm{Seen}_{s,i}(g,\\operatorname{cons}(y,c),0)\\\\\n&\\hspace{25mm}\\land\\forall u<y\\;\\exists j<i\\;(E_j(s)=g\\land I_j(s)=\\operatorname{cons}(u,c)\\land O_j(s)>0)\\Bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Good}(s)&\\longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{len}(s)>0\\land\n\\forall i<\\operatorname{len}(s)\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{len}([s]_i)=3\\land\n\\mathrm{Rule}(E_i(s),I_i(s),O_i(s);s,i)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathsf T^1(e,x,s)&\\longleftrightarrow a(e)=2\\land\\mathrm{Good}(s)\\land\nE_{\\max\\{\\operatorname{len}(s),1\\}-1}(s)=e\\land I_{\\max\\{\\operatorname{len}(s),1\\}-1}(s)=\\operatorname{sc}(\\langle x\\rangle),\\\\\nU(s)&\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}O_{\\max\\{\\operatorname{len}(s),1\\}-1}(s)&\\operatorname{len}(s)>0,\\\\0&\\operatorname{len}(s)=0,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\Phi_e&\\coloneqq\\{(x,y)\\in\\omega^2:\\exists s\\in\\omega\\;(\\mathsf T^1(e,x,s)\\land U(s)=y)\\},\\\\\n\\forall e,x,s,t\\in\\omega\\;&\\bigl((\\mathsf T^1(e,x,s)\\land\\mathsf T^1(e,x,t))\\to U(s)=U(t)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\chi_T&:\\omega^3\\to\\{0,1\\},\\\\\n\\chi_T(e,x,s)&\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1&\\mathsf T^1(e,x,s),\\\\0&\\neg\\mathsf T^1(e,x,s),\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\chi_T&\\in\\mathrm{PR}^{18}_3,\\qquad \\operatorname{Lift}_1(U)\\in\\mathrm{PR}^{18}_1.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\#_{\\mathrm{PR}}(S)&\\coloneqq p_S,&\n\\#_{\\mathrm{PR}}(C_k^n)&\\coloneqq p_C(n,k),&\n\\#_{\\mathrm{PR}}(P_i^n)&\\coloneqq p_P(n,i-1),\\\\\n\\#_{\\mathrm{PR}}(\\operatorname{Sub}(g,h_1,\\ldots,h_m))\n&\\coloneqq p_{\\mathrm{sub}}(\\#_{\\mathrm{PR}}(g),\\langle\\#_{\\mathrm{PR}}(h_1),\\ldots,\\#_{\\mathrm{PR}}(h_m)\\rangle),\\\\\n\\#_{\\mathrm{PR}}(\\operatorname{Rec}(g,h))&\\coloneqq\np_{\\mathrm{rec}}(\\#_{\\mathrm{PR}}(g),\\#_{\\mathrm{PR}}(h)),\\\\\nM_n(g)&\\coloneqq\\{\\#_{\\mathrm{PR}}(t):t\\in\\mathrm{PRTerm}_n,\\ \\forall\\vec x\\in\\omega^n\\;(\\operatorname{ev}(t,\\vec x)=g(\\vec x))\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Rep}_n(g)&\\coloneqq\\iota t\\in\\mathrm{PRTerm}_n\\;(\\#_{\\mathrm{PR}}(t)=\\min M_n(g))\n\\quad(g\\in\\mathrm{PR}^{18}_n),\\\\\na_T&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Rep}_3(\\chi_T).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Lift}_1","display":false}],"bytes":8700,"backlinks":[{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./18-df-computation-coding]]"},{"id":"115b03357940aa38","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S,T,\\iota$ 满足 [[18-df-arithmetic-realization]]：$S$ 为一阶签名，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S$，$\\iota$ 是从源算术公式到目标公式的固定单值图，并包含下式全部 $\\mathrm{Total}_e$。$\\mathfrak T=\\langle S,T,\\iota\\rangle$。$\\mathsf T^1,U,a_T,\\Phi_e$ 全部采用 [[18-df-computation-coding]] 的本地计算编码，不能另取未提供的外部接口。$f:\\omega\\to\\omega$ 是真实总函数；$e\\in\\omega$，$\\overline e$ 是 [[18-df-arithmetic-tait-language]] 的数码；$x_0,x_1$ 是该语言固定枚举中的前两个数变量；终止公式的绑定位置仅使用这两个变量。$\\mathrm{Total}_e$ 是 Tait 公式，$a_T$ 作为三元本原递归函数符号使用。"},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23","anchor":"ref-23","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-computation-coding]]"},{"id":"bf01645e59119446","anchor":"ref-20","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-computation-coding|18-df-computation-coding]]"}],"outgoing":["f04544345afa1f92","88497c28c97d78b7"]}